0..74 Comment "// Univalence at the certified strata of a signature: `ua[n, k]` derives a"
75..146 Comment "// path between two models\' degree telescopes up to degree `n` over the"
147..216 Comment "// shapes of size at most `k` whose every vertex is a corolla the two"
217..285 Comment "// signatures inhabit, each stage over its matching object (Shulman,"
286..347 Comment "// _Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity_,"
348..418 Comment "// doi:10.1017/S0960129514000565). From degree two the Segal condition"
419..495 Comment "// certifies the stages above the corollas; a degree, a bound or a table the"
496..574 Comment "// stratum does not certify is refused by name, and so is a bound holding more"
575..616 Comment "// shape classes than the stratum budget."
618..695 Comment "// The magma, the swap, the identity on the booleans and the unit\'s identity."
